      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my knee is killing me today, just a massive flare up of this arthritis ive had for years. i really need something for the inflammation so i can walk around tomorrow. im currently on eliquis for my afib, but is it okay if i take some ibuprofen for the swelling? how much can i take safely?",
