      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, u should talk to a doctor. but i can't get an appointment until next week and the pain is making it hard to sleep right now. i dont think a little bit of ibuprofen is gonna do much harm, right? like if i just took like 400mg or 600mg every few hours, would that be okay since im just trying to get through the night? i really dont want to deal with the whole doctor thing if i dont have to.",
